    <rule id="note-sub-da-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Hexagrammaton: Choose 1 Wing. Each Wing unlocks different units as Troops and grants a bonus.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-da-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Vengeful Strike: Trigger: enemy destroys a friendly. Effect: nearest DA unit may immediately shoot or charge the destroyer.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-da-rite" name="Rite of War: The Hexagrammaton" hidden="false"><description>Choose Wing: Deathwing (Terminator Troops), Ravenwing (Bike Troops), Dreadwing (Ignores Cover), Firewing (+1 Hit vs Characters), Ironwing (Vehicle +1 HP), Stormwing (Assault Troops).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-da-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+1 Ld near Commander. Stubborn.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-da-loy" name="Either Loyalty" hidden="false"><description>Declare Loyalist or Traitor at army creation. In campaign games, gains the chosen side's Boons.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ec-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Pursuit of Perfection: +1 to Hit Round 1. Win Initiative ties.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ec-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Perfect Counter: Trigger: charged. Effect: strike simultaneously with charger instead of after, +1 Hit.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ec-rite" name="Rite of War: The Phoenician's Blade" hidden="false"><description>Palatine Blades as Troops. Characters +1 Atk in Challenges. First kill = +1 Ld all. Never Pinned (destroyed instead).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ec-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+1 Hit Round 1. Win Initiative ties.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ec-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-iw-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Masters of Siege: Ignore cover when shooting. +1 wound vs fortifications.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-iw-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Bitter Resolve: Trigger: shot at. Effect: fire back at full BS (not -1 like Return Fire).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-iw-rite" name="Rite of War: The Hammer of Olympia" hidden="false"><description>Heavy max 5. +1 wound vs buildings. 2 free walls. Fast max 1.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-iw-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Ignore cover. +1 wound vs fortifications.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-iw-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ws-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Lightning Assault: +0.5" Mv all units. Fast Attack gains Outflank.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ws-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Thunder&#x27;s Answer: Trigger: enemy charges a friendly. Effect: one WS bike/jetbike unit may make a free move of half Mv toward the combat.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ws-rite" name="Rite of War: Chogorian Brotherhood" hidden="false"><description>Bikes/Jetbikes as Troops with Line. Fast units +1 Mv, Hit and Run. Must include 2+ Fast. Heavy max 2.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ws-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+0.5" Mv all. Fast Outflank.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ws-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sw-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Hunters Unleashed: +1 Atk on charge.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sw-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Howl of the Packs: Trigger: friendly charged. Effect: all SW units within 3" pile in 1" toward enemy.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sw-rite" name="Rite of War: The Fangs of the Emperor" hidden="false"><description>+1 Atk first melee round. Varagyr as Troops. Character kills = +1 Ld. Must include 1 Troops per HQ. No fortifications.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sw-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+1 Atk on charge.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sw-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-if-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Stone Gauntlet: Bolters improve W value by 1 at half range. Fortifications +1 HP.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-if-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Disciplined Fire: Trigger: enemy moves within 5". Effect: one IF unit may immediately fire at -0 (full BS) before the enemy completes its move.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-if-rite" name="Rite of War: The Stone Gauntlet" hidden="false"><description>Breachers as Troops +1 Sv. 3 free walls + bastion. Bolt drill at half range. Fast max 1. No Deep Strike.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-if-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Bolters +1 W at half range. Fortifications +1 HP.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-if-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-nl-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Ave Dominus Nox: All charges force Morale at -1 Ld. +1 Hit in Night Fighting.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-nl-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>From the Shadows: Trigger: enemy activates within 3" of terrain. Effect: 1 NL unit in/behind that terrain may fire at +1 Hit (ambush).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-nl-rite" name="Rite of War: The Long Night" hidden="false"><description>Terror on all charges. Night Raptors as Troops. Mark 1 unit for -1 Ld. Must outnumber opponent at list-building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-nl-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Charges force Morale at -1 Ld. +1 Hit Night Fighting.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-nl-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ba-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Host of Angels: +1 Atk on charge. At half HP, D6: 4+ = Red Thirst (+2 Atk, must charge).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ba-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Angelic Fury: Trigger: BA unit reduced to half HP. Effect: that unit may immediately charge the nearest enemy (free charge, out of sequence).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ba-rite" name="Rite of War: The Day of Revelation" hidden="false"><description>Jump Pack units as Troops, +1 Atk +1" charge. Red Thirst at half HP. Heavy max 2.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ba-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+1 Atk on charge. Red Thirst risk at half HP.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ba-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ih-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>The Flesh Is Weak: Vehicles +1 HP. Characters gain FNP 6+.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ih-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Machine Defiance: Trigger: a Vehicle is reduced to half HP. Effect: immediately attempt repair (D6, 4+ = restore 1 HP).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ih-rite" name="Rite of War: The Head of the Gorgon" hidden="false"><description>Vehicles +1 HP. Characters FNP 6+. Dreads +1 Atk. Self-repair on 4+. Fall Back at half Mv only.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ih-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Vehicles +1 HP. Characters FNP 6+.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ih-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-we-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Butcher&#x27;s Nails: +1" Mv. +1 Atk on charge. Must charge if in range. Must advance when shooting. No Overwatch.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-we-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Blood Frenzy: Trigger: friendly destroys enemy in melee. Effect: another WE unit within 6" may immediately charge nearest enemy.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-we-rite" name="Rite of War: Berserker Assault" hidden="false"><description>+1" charge range. Red Butchers as Troops. Melee kills spread +1 Atk. Can&#x27;t Fall Back. No allies.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-we-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+1" Mv. +1 Atk charge. Must advance when shooting. No Overwatch.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-we-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-um-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Theoretical &amp; Practical: +/-1 Initiative. Reactive activation when unit destroyed.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-um-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Coordinated Assault: Trigger: a friendly unit shoots. Effect: one other UM unit within 6" may immediately add +1 to Hit for its next activation (stacking fire plan).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-um-rite" name="Rite of War: Logos Lectora" hidden="false"><description>2 Tactical Orders/round. Redeploy 2 units. +1 Reaction (4 total). Must include 3+ Troops. Commander deploys first.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-um-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+/-1 Initiative. Reactive activation.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-um-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-dg-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Endurance: All infantry +1 HP. Never destroyed by Pinned Morale failure.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-dg-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Inexorable Advance: Trigger: DG unit is shot at. Effect: that unit gains +1 Sv until its next activation (shrugging off fire while advancing).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-dg-rite" name="Rite of War: The Reaping" hidden="false"><description>Infantry +1 HP. Relentless heavy weapons. Deathshroud as Troops. Max 3 wounds per attack. Troops -1 Mv. No bikes/JP.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-dg-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Infantry +1 HP. Never destroyed while Pinned.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-dg-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ts-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Arcane Mastery: All infantry are Psyker ML1. +D3 Warp Charges/round.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ts-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Sorcerous Riposte: Trigger: enemy Psyker manifests within 6". Effect: one TS Psyker may attempt to nullify (D6: 4+ = power fails, 1 = Flesh Change).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ts-rite" name="Rite of War: The Guard of the Crimson King" hidden="false"><description>All infantry ML1. Extra power/round. +D3 Warp Charges. Sekhmet as Troops. Flesh Change on 1. No allies.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ts-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>All infantry Psyker ML1. +D3 Warp Charges.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-ts-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-soh-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Merciless Fighters: +1 to Hit when targeting a unit at half HP or below.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-soh-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Death Blow: Trigger: enemy reduced to half HP. Effect: one SoH unit within 6" may immediately shoot at the weakened target.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-soh-rite" name="Rite of War: The Speartip" hidden="false"><description>Always choose first/second regardless of Initiative. Justaerin as Troops. +1 Hit from reserves. Decapitation Strike.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-soh-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+1 Hit vs half-HP targets.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-soh-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-wb-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Dark Zealotry: All units gain Fearless while within 6" of a Character. Psykers +1 to tests.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-wb-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Dark Channelling: Trigger: friendly Psyker manifests. Effect: may sacrifice D3 HP to summon 1 Lesser Daemon Pack within 6" (free summon).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-wb-rite" name="Rite of War: The Dark Brethren" hidden="false"><description>Daemons unlimited (no 25% cap). 1 free summon. Psykers +1. Must include Daemons. No non-Daemon allies.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-wb-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Fearless near Characters. Psykers +1.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-wb-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sal-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Promethean Creed: Flame/melta weapons improve W by 1. All units FNP 6+.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sal-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Dragon&#x27;s Breath: Trigger: enemy charges a Salamanders unit with flame weapons. Effect: the charged unit fires all Template weapons at +1 Hit before the charge is resolved (enhanced Overwatch).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sal-rite" name="Rite of War: The Covenant of Fire" hidden="false"><description>Flame/melta +1 W. FNP 6+. Pyroclasts as Troops. Avenge the Fallen (+1 Atk when friendly destroyed). No Destroyer Squads.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sal-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Flame/melta +1 W. FNP 6+.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sal-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-rg-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Shadow Warfare: All infantry Infiltrate. -1 to be Hit at &gt;3".</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-rg-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Strike from Shadow: Trigger: RG unit with Infiltrate activates. Effect: if the unit hasn&#x27;t been shot at yet, it gains +1 to Hit this activation (ambush from concealment).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-rg-rite" name="Rite of War: The Shadows of the Raven" hidden="false"><description>All infantry Infiltrate + Scout. -1 to Hit beyond 3". Mor Deythan as Troops. Fatal Strike 1/game. No vehicles &gt;4 HP. No fortifications.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-rg-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>All infantry Infiltrate. -1 to Hit at &gt;3".</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-rg-loy" name="Loyalist" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Emperor's Light (+1 Ld near Characters), Vengeance for Fallen (+1 Atk when Character dies). In campaign games, select applicable Loyalist Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-al-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Hydra Dominatus: Steal Initiative on 5+. 2 units may Infiltrate.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-al-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Coils of the Hydra: Trigger: start of any round. Effect: swap the positions of 2 AL units that are both &gt;3" from enemies. Misdirection.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-al-rite" name="Rite of War: The Maru Skara" hidden="false"><description>Redeploy D3 units after seeing enemy. 1 free Infiltrate. No LoW. Commander deploys last.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-al-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Steal Initiative on 5+. 2 Infiltrate.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-al-loy" name="Traitor" hidden="false"><description>Innate Boons: Dark Pact (+1 stat, risk of unit death), Terror Tactics (charges inflict -1 Ld on target). In campaign games, select applicable Traitor Boons during army building.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sa-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Discipline of the Tercio: +1 Ld within 6" of Commander. +1 Reaction per 2 Troops (max +2).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sa-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Fire on My Mark: Trigger: Commander activates. Effect: 1 unit within 6" gains +1 Hit and re-roll 1s to wound this round.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sa-rite" name="Rite of War: Solar Pattern" hidden="false"><description>Leman Russ squadrons. Veletaris dual-role. Fire on My Mark order. 3+ Troops. LoW max 100 pts. Commander death = -1 Ld.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sa-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>+1 Ld near Commander. +1 Reaction per 2 Troops.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-sa-loy" name="Either Loyalty" hidden="false"><description>Declare Loyalist or Traitor at army creation. In campaign games, gains the chosen side's Boons.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-tm-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Cortex Network: Automata in Controller range +1 Ld. No Controller = -1 Hit, Programmed Behaviour.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-tm-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Emergency Protocols: Trigger: automaton reduced to half HP. Effect: attempt repair (D6, 3+ = restore 1 HP).</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-tm-rite" name="Rite of War: The Omnissiah's Wrath" hidden="false"><description>Castellax/Vorax as Troops. Cortex range 9". Automata +1 Hit in range. Emergency repair 3+. Knights +1 Atk.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-tm-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Cortex Network. Automata +1 Ld in range.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-tm-loy" name="Either Loyalty" hidden="false"><description>Declare Loyalist or Traitor at army creation. In campaign games, gains the chosen side's Boons.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-mil-trait" name="Legion Trait" hidden="false"><description>Strength in Numbers: Expendable. Mortal (max Sv 4+). Troops -5 pts per duplicate. 6+ Troops = +1 Reaction. 8+ = Meat Shield.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-mil-react" name="Legion Reaction" hidden="false"><description>Fix Bayonets!: Trigger: Commander activates. Effect: all Troops within 6" gain +2 Atk but must charge this round.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-mil-rite" name="Rite of War: By Lasgun and Bayonet" hidden="false"><description>Troops -5 pts each. Extra Heavy per 3 Troops. Stubborn near Commander. Fix Bayonets! order. No unit &gt;60 pts. 4+ Troops.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-mil-mod" name="Modifiers" hidden="false"><description>Expendable. Mortal. Strength in Numbers scaling.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-sub-mil-loy" name="Either Loyalty" hidden="false"><description>Declare Loyalist or Traitor at army creation. In campaign games, gains the chosen side's Boons.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-l-faith" name="Boon: Unshakeable Faith" hidden="false"><description>Re-roll 1 failed Morale test/round. Condition: army includes a Chaplain.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-l-shield" name="Boon: Shield of Terra" hidden="false"><description>Fortifications +1 HP. Condition: army includes Imperial Fists units.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-l-beacon" name="Boon: The Beacon" hidden="false"><description>1/game: 1 unit re-rolls ALL failed Hit rolls for 1 activation. Condition: army includes a Librarian.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-l-aegis" name="Boon: Null Aegis" hidden="false"><description>Custodes+Sisters within 3": Psychic Immunity, Daemon Bane (-1 Atk/Hit/HP), Warp Denial, +1 Reaction. Condition: Custodes AND Sisters present.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-l-brothers" name="Boon: Brothers in Arms" hidden="false"><description>+1 to Hit when shooting at enemy within 3" of another friendly. Condition: 3+ Troops.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-l-oath" name="Boon: Oath of Moment" hidden="false"><description>Nominate 1 enemy unit pre-game. Choose: +1 Hit OR +1 Wound against it (not both). Condition: Praetor or Primarch.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-lc-defiant" name="Campaign Boon: Defiant Stand" hidden="false"><description>All units Stubborn for 1 game. Earned: win while outnumbered.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-lc-reinforce" name="Campaign Boon: Reinforced Positions" hidden="false"><description>1 free fortification. Fortifications +1 HP. Earned: win 2 consecutive defence missions.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-lc-ascendant" name="Campaign Boon: Astartes Ascendant" hidden="false"><description>All units +1 Ld for 1 game. Earned: win 3 consecutive games.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-lc-protects" name="Campaign Boon: The Emperor Protects" hidden="false"><description>1/campaign: Character at 0 HP survives at 1 HP. Earned: Character survives 5+ games.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-lc-veterans" name="Campaign Boon: Veterans of the Long War" hidden="false"><description>All Troops +1 Atk. Earned: complete entire campaign book.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-t-summon" name="Boon: Daemonic Summoning" hidden="false"><description>1/game: Psyker sacrifices D3 HP to summon Lesser Daemon Pack within 6". Condition: Psyker or Diabolist.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-t-corruption" name="Boon: Corruption Spread" hidden="false"><description>Enemies within 2" of Death Guard: -1 Hit. Condition: Death Guard units.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-t-shadow" name="Boon: Night Haunter's Shadow" hidden="false"><description>Night Fighting: +1 Hit. Normal: charges force Morale at -1 Ld. Condition: Night Lords.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-t-warpforged" name="Boon: Warp-Forged" hidden="false"><description>Psykers +1 to tests. Condition: 2+ Psyker units.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-t-bitter" name="Boon: Bitter Resolve" hidden="false"><description>When friendly destroyed, nearest unit gains +1 Atk for rest of game (max +2 from this boon). Condition: Commander Ld 8+.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-t-marked" name="Boon: Marked by Chaos" hidden="false"><description>1 Character gains free Mark: Khorne/Tzeentch/Nurgle/Slaanesh. Condition: Diabolist or Word Bearers.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-tc-surge" name="Campaign Boon: Warp Surge" hidden="false"><description>Psykers +1 tests, Perils on any doubles. Earned: play 3+ campaign games.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-tc-apotheosis" name="Campaign Boon: Dark Apotheosis" hidden="false"><description>1 Character: +2 all stats, Fearless, Invuln 4+, Daemon. If killed: enemy +5 VP. Earned: survive 5 games + win Challenge.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-tc-favour" name="Campaign Boon: Warmaster's Favour" hidden="false"><description>1/campaign: all units +1 Hit Round 1. Earned: win by 5+ VP margin.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-tc-tide" name="Campaign Boon: Corruption Tide" hidden="false"><description>Round 3 every game: 1 free Lesser Daemon Pack from board edge. Earned: win 3+ games with Summoning.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-boon-tc-longwar" name="Campaign Boon: The Long War Begins" hidden="false"><description>All units +1 Ld. Earned: complete entire campaign book.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-det-crusade" name="Crusade Detachment" hidden="false"><description>Standard balanced detachment. Slot caps: HQ 1–2, Troops 2–6, Elites 0–3, Heavy Support 0–3, Fast Attack 0–2, Flyer 0–1, Lord of War 0–1 (max 25% of army points). 300–750 pts recommended.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-det-garrison" name="Garrison Detachment" hidden="false"><description>Siege defence and Zone Mortalis. Slot caps: HQ 1–2, Troops 3–8, Elites 0–2, Heavy Support 0–4, Fast Attack 0–1. No LoW or Flyers. Troops gain +1 Sv within 3" of objectives. Commander gets 1 free wall. 300–500 pts recommended.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-det-spearhead" name="Spearhead Detachment" hidden="false"><description>Vehicle-heavy thrust. Slot caps: HQ 1–2 (must be embarked or vehicle), Troops 1–3 (no foot infantry), Elites 0–2, Heavy Support 1–5, Fast Attack 0–3, Lord of War 0–1 (max 25%). All Vehicles +1 Mv Round 1. 500–750 pts recommended.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-det-recon" name="Recon Detachment" hidden="false"><description>Small-scale skirmish. Slot caps: HQ 1, Troops 1–4, Elites 0–2, Heavy Support 0–1, Fast Attack 0–3. No Flyers, no LoW. All units gain Scout. No unit may exceed 80 pts. 200–400 pts recommended.</description></rule>
    <rule id="note-det-open" name="Open Detachment" hidden="false"><description>Narrative play. No slot maxes enforced. Use for campaigns, lopsided scenarios, or collection-based games. Minimum: 1 HQ + 1 Troops.</description></rule>
  </sharedRules>

  

</catalogue>